// Custom instruction sequence to demonstrate pipeline hazards
00500093 // addi x1, x0, 5
00108133 // add x2, x1, x1  (Data Hazard - Forwarding)
00002183 // lw x3, 0(x0)
40118233 // sub x4, x3, x1  (Load-Use Hazard - Stall)
00108463 // beq x1, x1, 8   (Control Hazard - Branch Taken)
00900293 // addi x5, x0, 9  (Flushed!)
00a00313 // addi x6, x0, 10 (Branch Target)
